1
00:01:33,070 --> 00:01:38,180
[First Love Again]

2
00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:40,880
[Episode 20]

3
00:01:41,039 --> 00:01:43,070
[Jiangcheng University
Sports and Cultural Center]

4
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:44,120
Thank you, Senior.

5
00:01:43,250 --> 00:01:47,390
[JCU Basketball Team
Fan Appreciation Event]

6
00:01:44,229 --> 00:01:45,710
Would you like an autograph?

7
00:01:45,710 --> 00:01:46,640
-Thanks.
-Okay.

8
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:47,870
You're welcome.

9
00:01:48,350 --> 00:01:49,479
Hold on. Here you go.

10
00:01:49,590 --> 00:01:50,479
-Thanks.
-Thanks, Senior.

11
00:01:50,479 --> 00:01:51,539
Thank you, Senior.

12
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,229
Sorry to trouble you, Senior.

13
00:01:53,229 --> 00:01:53,920
Would you like an autograph?

14
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:54,870
Sign here for me.

15
00:01:55,710 --> 00:01:56,640
Me too! Me too!

16
00:01:56,670 --> 00:01:57,430
-Thanks.
-Here.

17
00:01:57,430 --> 00:01:58,710
-Here.
-Me too! Me too!

18
00:01:58,710 --> 00:01:59,560
Thanks, Senior.

19
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,510
-Would you like an autograph?
-Senior, you're so handsome!

20
00:02:00,510 --> 00:02:01,770
Let me sign one for you.

21
00:02:01,950 --> 00:02:02,590
Sirui,

22
00:02:02,790 --> 00:02:03,840
do you have enough gifts left?

23
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:05,370
Let me sign one for you, too.

24
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,120
Here.

25
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,080
Sirui,

26
00:02:08,630 --> 00:02:09,430
what's wrong?

27
00:02:09,910 --> 00:02:10,400
Nothing.

28
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,800
Senior, could I get your autograph?

29
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,840
Thank you, Senior.

30
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:13,530
Sure, sure.

31
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:15,220
Could you sign one for me, too?

32
00:02:17,970 --> 00:02:20,110
[JCU Basketball Team
Fan Appreciation Event]

33
00:02:19,150 --> 00:02:21,030
Senior, can we take a picture with you?

34
00:02:21,030 --> 00:02:21,840
Sure, of course.

35
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:23,440
Let's do it here. Right here.

36
00:02:24,630 --> 00:02:27,230
[JCU Basketball Team
Fan Appreciation Event]

37
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:26,300
Over here. Come on, hurry!

38
00:02:27,910 --> 00:02:29,120
You guys, come over here, too.

39
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,190
I'll take a picture of you guys.

40
00:02:30,190 --> 00:02:30,960
Okay.

41
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:33,079
Three, two, one!

42
00:02:33,870 --> 00:02:34,590
I want a picture, too!

43
00:02:34,590 --> 00:02:35,560
Thanks. Here.

44
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,630
Could you take a picture of me, too?

45
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:38,290
Could you sign one for me, too?

46
00:02:39,490 --> 00:02:40,720
Move closer.

47
00:02:40,750 --> 00:02:41,680
Closer. Yeah, that's it.

48
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,280
All done.

49
00:02:43,310 --> 00:02:44,240
Let's take one with the three of us.

50
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,400
Sure, get ready.

51
00:02:46,150 --> 00:02:47,630
Three, two, one!

52
00:02:49,310 --> 00:02:50,240
Senior! Senior!

53
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,710
I'm a fan of yours, too.

54
00:02:51,750 --> 00:02:53,590
I made these sandwiches myself.

55
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:56,520
Thanks.

56
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,430
Sorry, you two,

57
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:01,910
but I need to spend some time
with my girlfriend.

58
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:02,620
-Sure, sure.
-Come on,

59
00:03:02,620 --> 00:03:03,620
let me sign an autograph for you.

60
00:03:03,500 --> 00:03:05,880
[JCU Basketball Team
Fan Appreciation Event]

61
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:05,870
Don't run off, guys!

62
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,000
Not bad.

63
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:13,920
What's wrong?

64
00:03:19,310 --> 00:03:20,079
Jealous?

65
00:03:21,150 --> 00:03:21,870
No.

66
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:28,470
Aren't you going
to the Starry Skylater later?

67
00:03:28,470 --> 00:03:29,600
I'll take you there.

68
00:03:30,630 --> 00:03:32,150
No need.

69
00:03:32,750 --> 00:03:33,680
You're so busy.

70
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,360
I'll go by myself.

71
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,750
I've already eaten your sandwich.

72
00:03:38,750 --> 00:03:40,480
Let me take you there. Let's go.

73
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,280
Really, it's fine.

74
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:44,010
I know you have practice later.

75
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:47,120
Are you sure?

76
00:03:51,430 --> 00:03:52,690
Remember to finish it.

77
00:04:08,710 --> 00:04:09,800
Defense! Defense! Defense!

78
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:11,000
-Get back!
-Get back!

79
00:04:12,910 --> 00:04:14,240
Set a screen! Over here!

80
00:04:14,750 --> 00:04:15,800
Set a screen! Set a screen!

81
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:17,680
Left! Set a screen!

82
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:28,750
Li Sirui,

83
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,630
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

84
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,000
what's going on with you?

85
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,750
How many times have we
gone over this play?

86
00:04:32,750 --> 00:04:34,390
Why aren't you paying attention?

87
00:04:34,390 --> 00:04:36,050
Don't waste everyone's time.

88
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:37,630
Sorry, Tian.

89
00:04:38,270 --> 00:04:39,270
Let's do it again.

90
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,430
-Come on.
-Come on.

91
00:04:41,370 --> 00:04:42,770
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

92
00:04:45,630 --> 00:04:46,760
Whose phone is that?

93
00:04:47,830 --> 00:04:48,800
You should know to turn your phone off
during practice.

94
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,870
It's common sense.

95
00:04:49,870 --> 00:04:50,530
Whose is it?

96
00:04:51,750 --> 00:04:53,040
Sorry, that's mine.

97
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,190
This...

98
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,630
Sorry, Tian.

99
00:05:08,650 --> 00:05:11,300
Something urgent came up
at my internship.

100
00:05:11,330 --> 00:05:12,390
I have to leave now.

101
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:18,020
You really haven't been yourself lately.

102
00:05:18,020 --> 00:05:21,870
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

103
00:05:18,630 --> 00:05:20,630
I hope you can get back on track soon.

104
00:05:20,870 --> 00:05:22,190
The quarterfinals are coming up,

105
00:05:22,190 --> 00:05:23,790
and the whole team needs you.

106
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:27,270
I really have to go.

107
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:33,310
Fine, go. Go ahead.

108
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:34,370
Ziming, you're up.

109
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:35,870
Yes, Coach.

110
00:05:38,870 --> 00:05:40,330
Come on, let's keep going.

111
00:05:41,159 --> 00:05:41,920
Come on, come on!

112
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,530
Let's keep going.

113
00:05:42,530 --> 00:05:43,790
-Keep going.
-Come on.

114
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:45,430
-Watch your defense.
-Come on.

115
00:05:45,430 --> 00:05:45,960
Come on.

116
00:05:46,330 --> 00:05:48,159
Next, let's talk about the other teams'

117
00:05:47,340 --> 00:05:52,120
[24s]

118
00:05:48,190 --> 00:05:49,870
prospects in the quarterfinals,

119
00:05:49,870 --> 00:05:52,390
starting with JCU versus JNU.

120
00:05:52,210 --> 00:05:56,570
[The Starry Sky]

121
00:05:52,870 --> 00:05:53,750
I'm sure everyone

122
00:05:53,750 --> 00:05:55,950
still remembers JCU 's struggle

123
00:05:55,950 --> 00:05:57,040
to make it through the play-in round.

124
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:59,390
With a new coach and new tactics,

125
00:05:59,409 --> 00:06:01,940
the team has become much more cohesive.

126
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:04,270
[The UBA quarterfinals are about to begin]

127
00:06:02,190 --> 00:06:03,600
Now, besides Gu Han,

128
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,390
Chen Yu and Li Sirui

129
00:06:05,390 --> 00:06:07,130
can also share the ball-handling duties.

130
00:06:07,130 --> 00:06:08,720
And as a shooter, Chen Yu

131
00:06:08,750 --> 00:06:10,800
can run pick-and-rolls with Gu Han.

132
00:06:11,140 --> 00:06:12,800
Xiangxiang sure knows her stuff.

133
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,560
She makes it all sound so convincing.

134
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:15,750
JCU has a more diverse range of plays now.

135
00:06:14,070 --> 00:06:15,460
[The UBA quarterfinals are about to begin]

136
00:06:15,870 --> 00:06:17,270
I think Xiangxiang is absolutely right.

137
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:18,720
She even pointed out all our strengths.

138
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:20,820
True. They're not the same team
they used to be.

139
00:06:20,820 --> 00:06:23,060
Everyone on JCU has a role to play.

140
00:06:23,190 --> 00:06:23,920
Of course,

141
00:06:23,950 --> 00:06:25,510
team captain Gu Han

142
00:06:25,510 --> 00:06:27,000
still plays the most crucial role.

143
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,480
After all, everyone knows

144
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,680
how talented he is.

145
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:32,630
Captain,

146
00:06:32,950 --> 00:06:35,040
she just praised you in front of everyone.

147
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:37,240
Aren't you going to say something back?

148
00:06:40,310 --> 00:06:41,170
He's blushing.

149
00:06:42,159 --> 00:06:43,120
Hello, host.

150
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,600
I met my girlfriend

151
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:46,870
at a JCU friendly match.

152
00:06:47,130 --> 00:06:48,280
We promised to watch

153
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:50,830
every JCU game from now on.

154
00:06:51,430 --> 00:06:52,870
But now my girlfriend

155
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,510
seems a little upset.

156
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:56,190
What should I do?

157
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:59,000
This viewer is so cute!

158
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,460
This is a basketball show,

159
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:02,430
and yet we got a relationship question.

160
00:07:02,430 --> 00:07:03,690
You've got me stumped!

161
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,730
Xiangxiang, what do you think?

162
00:07:07,630 --> 00:07:09,310
Thanks for the question.

163
00:07:09,750 --> 00:07:12,270
Honestly, I think
as long as you're thoughtful,

164
00:07:12,270 --> 00:07:14,270
it's not that hard to cheer a girl up.

165
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:16,360
For example, on a scorching summer day,

166
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,870
bringing her a nice, cold drink

167
00:07:17,870 --> 00:07:19,240
would be a great idea.

168
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,260
I think Xiangxiang is absolutely right.

169
00:07:22,450 --> 00:07:27,680
[The Starry Sky]

170
00:07:29,750 --> 00:07:31,120
Thanks, Xiangxiang.

171
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,360
You're so thoughtful,

172
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:35,090
ordering milk tea for us
even when you're so busy.

173
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:41,880
Thanks, Xiangxiang.

174
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:45,300
You're welcome. You all worked hard.

175
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:47,710
[Milk Tea]
[Note: Zhou Xiangxiang]

176
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,920
Well, well, Gu Han...

177
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,370
What are you doing here?

178
00:08:05,710 --> 00:08:06,440
I missed you.

179
00:08:09,190 --> 00:08:11,040
I'm here under orders from Ms. Wan

180
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,900
to take Miss Zhou home for dinner.

181
00:08:28,590 --> 00:08:30,900
[East Wing]

182
00:08:36,870 --> 00:08:39,720
No more using public resources
to show off your relationship,

183
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,480
got it?

184
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,060
What are you doing?

185
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:58,870
It's just the two of us here.

186
00:08:58,870 --> 00:09:01,470
There's no such thing
as public resources now.

187
00:09:27,510 --> 00:09:29,200
Here, have some more.

188
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,900
Thank you, Auntie.

189
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:33,910
That's pretty much how things went

190
00:09:33,910 --> 00:09:35,360
when we were in Kunzhou.

191
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,480
You have no idea

192
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:38,080
how much my parents like him.

193
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:41,910
That's good.

194
00:09:42,270 --> 00:09:44,360
I was worried Gu Han
might not be very good

195
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:46,270
with words and upset your parents.

196
00:09:46,270 --> 00:09:47,000
Not at all.

197
00:09:48,630 --> 00:09:49,790
Come to think of it,

198
00:09:49,790 --> 00:09:52,080
it's been over ten years
since we last saw them.

199
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:53,670
We left in such a hurry last time

200
00:09:53,670 --> 00:09:54,790
that I didn't even get

201
00:09:54,790 --> 00:09:56,920
to thank them for taking care of Gu Han.

202
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,510
We should invite them
to Jiangcheng next time

203
00:09:58,510 --> 00:10:00,150
and have a proper get-together.

204
00:10:00,150 --> 00:10:01,880
My parents said the same thing.

205
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,080
Thank you.

206
00:10:40,670 --> 00:10:41,480
Xiangxiang,

207
00:10:42,630 --> 00:10:44,030
what have you done to him?

208
00:10:45,390 --> 00:10:47,360
Ever since you two got together,

209
00:10:47,390 --> 00:10:49,920
he seems like
a completely different person.

210
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,360
My classmate in Canada

211
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:03,620
sent me some information
about universities there again.

212
00:11:07,630 --> 00:11:08,630
But

213
00:11:09,630 --> 00:11:11,720
I want to wait until your games are over

214
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:13,450
before discussing it with you.

215
00:11:17,030 --> 00:11:18,080
Auntie, so you're saying

216
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:20,080
you'll come watch the final, right?

217
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:21,870
That's great!

218
00:11:23,750 --> 00:11:25,480
Come on, dig in

219
00:11:25,790 --> 00:11:27,250
before the food gets cold.

220
00:11:30,790 --> 00:11:31,600
Son,

221
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,530
here, have some.

222
00:11:32,910 --> 00:11:34,670
Xiangxiang, you too.

223
00:11:35,310 --> 00:11:36,360
-Take this.
-Auntie, you should eat, too.

224
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:36,910
Okay.

225
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:42,480
More than half of JNU's possessions

226
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:44,790
involve simple pick-and-rolls

227
00:11:44,150 --> 00:11:46,750
[Jingnan University]
[Yang Chutian] [Tang Bin]

228
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:47,320
between their center, Yang Chutian,

229
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,960
and their guard, Tang Bin.

230
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:50,100
So remember,

231
00:11:50,590 --> 00:11:52,630
don't double-team Yang Chutian.

232
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:54,460
[Jingnan University]
[Yang Chutian] [Tang Bin]

233
00:11:53,270 --> 00:11:54,790
Just provide

234
00:11:55,030 --> 00:11:56,200
early help defense

235
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,320
against Tang Bin. That's all.

236
00:11:57,130 --> 00:11:58,280
[Jingnan University]
[Yang Chutian] [Tang Bin]

237
00:11:57,670 --> 00:11:58,340
Got it?

238
00:11:58,730 --> 00:11:59,750
-Got it.
-Got it.

239
00:12:00,550 --> 00:12:02,880
I know we've been
knocked out at this stage

240
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:05,000
for the past few years.

241
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,720
Some have even said

242
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,440
this is our stumbling block,

243
00:12:08,550 --> 00:12:10,350
something we'll never get past.

244
00:12:11,550 --> 00:12:13,280
But I want you all to understand

245
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:15,000
that you're

246
00:12:15,510 --> 00:12:17,630
not the same team you were in the past.

247
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,330
Believe in yourselves.

248
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:21,050
Believe that this year,

249
00:12:21,550 --> 00:12:23,810
we'll make it beyond the quarterfinals.

250
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:25,670
Got it?

251
00:12:26,390 --> 00:12:27,480
-Got it.
-Got it.

252
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:30,390
All right,

253
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,240
that's all I have to say.

254
00:12:32,170 --> 00:12:35,540
[Jingnan University]
[Yang Chutian] [Tang Bin]

255
00:12:32,870 --> 00:12:36,000
Gu Han, come up here
and say a few words to the team.

256
00:12:55,150 --> 00:12:55,950
That's right.

257
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:58,840
We've been knocked out

258
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:01,040
in the quarterfinals two years in a row.

259
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:05,320
Every time, I told myself

260
00:13:06,390 --> 00:13:07,520
I still had a chance,

261
00:13:08,150 --> 00:13:09,950
that I could try again next year.

262
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:15,890
I still remember

263
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:17,790
watching Zhonghai University

264
00:13:17,790 --> 00:13:20,550
receive the trophy
on the championship podium last year.

265
00:13:20,550 --> 00:13:21,410
I was thinking,

266
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,170
why couldn't that be us?

267
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:25,670
Of course,

268
00:13:26,390 --> 00:13:28,190
you all still have more chances,

269
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:31,300
but I'm about to enter my senior year.

270
00:13:31,630 --> 00:13:32,960
This is my last year,

271
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:40,860
and I want to make
the most of this chance.

272
00:13:48,870 --> 00:13:49,670
Well said!

273
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:52,390
Come on, let's give it our all!

274
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:06,720
JCU!

275
00:14:07,270 --> 00:14:08,440
Let's go!

276
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:09,480
Let's go!

277
00:14:09,750 --> 00:14:11,360
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

278
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:20,150
Sirui just messaged in the group chat.

279
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:21,030
What did he say?

280
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:23,150
He missed practice,

281
00:14:23,270 --> 00:14:25,750
and now he's missing
the tactical briefing, too.

282
00:14:25,750 --> 00:14:26,870
"Sorry, everyone.

283
00:14:26,870 --> 00:14:28,270
Something urgent came up today,

284
00:14:28,270 --> 00:14:30,000
so I can't make it to practice."

285
00:14:30,030 --> 00:14:31,030
That's strange.

286
00:14:31,030 --> 00:14:33,360
Sirui never misses practice.

287
00:14:33,670 --> 00:14:34,870
Who knows?

288
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:37,510
All right,

289
00:14:37,510 --> 00:14:39,960
I'll send everyone the player profiles

290
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:41,080
