294
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:45,270
Got it.

295
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:50,050
How are things between you two?

296
00:14:50,550 --> 00:14:52,240
Pretty good. Same as usual.

297
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,480
Same as usual, huh?

298
00:14:59,870 --> 00:15:00,600
Xiangxiang.

299
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:08,120
You two are really

300
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:09,870
