320
00:15:57,150 --> 00:15:57,840
See you.

321
00:16:09,630 --> 00:16:11,200
You've worked hard
these past two days at the tryouts.

322
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:12,360
I've had you running
back and forth quite a bit.

323
00:16:12,270 --> 00:16:18,790
[Own the Court. Take Action Now.]

324
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:14,000
It's no trouble, Ms. Bai.

325
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:16,400
