425
00:20:45,030 --> 00:20:46,790
That's the only way
they'll get out of this slump.

426
00:20:46,790 --> 00:20:47,510
Right.

427
00:20:48,350 --> 00:20:49,480
Get back on defense!

428
00:20:51,400 --> 00:20:52,400
