454
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:42,260
Our company is planning to sign them.

455
00:21:42,680 --> 00:21:43,610
Not bad, not bad.

456
00:21:43,880 --> 00:21:45,350
Ms. Bai, honestly,

457
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:46,640
our basketball variety show

458
00:21:45,780 --> 00:21:47,130
[Le Xiaotao]

459
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:48,350
