00:24:58,160 --> 00:25:00,300
are you sure you won't
rest for another couple of days?

556
00:25:00,300 --> 00:25:01,300
The doctor told me

557
00:25:01,680 --> 00:25:02,750
I can't play,

558
00:25:02,790 --> 00:25:04,960
but he didn't say
I can't supervise your training.

559
00:25:04,960 --> 00:25:05,790
Trying to slack off?

560
00:25:05,790 --> 00:25:07,050
-No.
-Kong Fang just wants to slack off.

561
00:25:07,050 --> 00:25:08,910
-How is that possible?
-Exactly.

562
00:25:24,210 --> 00:25:25,630
Congratulations, everyone.

563
00:25:25,630 --> 00:25:27,030
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

564
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:28,740
What happened to you yesterday, really?

565
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:31,160
Nothing.

566
00:25:31,550 --> 00:25:32,550
Nothing?

567
00:25:33,070 --> 00:25:34,730
You bailed at the last minute,

568
00:25:35,070 --> 00:25:36,200
and the quarterfinals were so important.

569
00:25:35,860 --> 00:25:37,250
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

570
00:25:36,200 --> 00:25:38,000
None of us could get ahold of you.

571
00:25:42,790 --> 00:25:43,400
Guys,

572
00:25:44,750 --> 00:25:45,590
I'm sorry.

573
00:25:48,640 --> 00:25:50,790
Anyway, you still won

574
00:25:51,550 --> 00:25:52,720
even without me.

575
00:25:53,160 --> 00:25:54,470
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

576
00:25:53,720 --> 00:25:55,310
Did something happen to you?

577
00:25:55,310 --> 00:25:56,750
You have to tell us if something's wrong.

578
00:25:56,750 --> 00:25:58,950
Is something going on with your family?

579
00:26:05,030 --> 00:26:05,960
What's going on?

580
00:26:10,830 --> 00:26:12,890
Tian and I have already discussed it.

581
00:26:13,270 --> 00:26:14,310
I might not be able

582
00:26:16,310 --> 00:26:17,720
to take part in the rest of the games.

583
00:26:17,720 --> 00:26:18,440
What?

584
00:26:18,960 --> 00:26:20,360
What on earth is going on?

585
00:26:23,400 --> 00:26:24,030
I-I

586
00:26:26,350 --> 00:26:28,400
signed with Bai Xue's agency.

587
00:26:29,030 --> 00:26:30,350
My work schedule

588
00:26:31,590 --> 00:26:33,850
will conflict with the games from now on.

589
00:26:34,270 --> 00:26:35,350
I really have no choice.

590
00:26:35,350 --> 00:26:36,270
Li Sirui,

591
00:26:36,270 --> 00:26:38,160
do you remember what we said back then?

592
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:40,200
We were going to win
the championship for JCU.

593
00:26:40,200 --> 00:26:42,270
We're already in the semifinals.

594
00:26:44,480 --> 00:26:45,640
If you're really going through something,

595
00:26:45,640 --> 00:26:46,440
tell us.

596
00:26:46,440 --> 00:26:47,960
We can help you.

597
00:26:48,200 --> 00:26:50,160
-You can't help me.
-What do you mean we can't help you?

598
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:51,270
We're brothers!

599
00:26:51,270 --> 00:26:52,880
We've bled and sweated together,

600
00:26:52,880 --> 00:26:55,240
training and playing day and night.

601
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:56,720
Why do you think we've done all that?

602
00:26:56,720 --> 00:26:57,640
Now you're telling me that you—

603
00:26:57,640 --> 00:26:59,790
-Kong Fang.
-Li Sirui, what the hell do you mean?

604
00:26:59,790 --> 00:27:00,590
Look at him!

605
00:27:01,070 --> 00:27:02,110
He played through a knee injury

606
00:27:02,110 --> 00:27:04,000
to win yesterday's game.

607
00:27:04,350 --> 00:27:06,400
With you gone, he played all 40 minutes.

608
00:27:06,400 --> 00:27:07,330
Do you know that?

609
00:27:11,750 --> 00:27:13,640
Do you know how long

610
00:27:13,960 --> 00:27:16,350
we've been waiting for this championship?

611
00:27:16,350 --> 00:27:17,070
Sirui,

612
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:19,400
have you ever really considered us
your brothers?

613
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:20,510
How could you put your own interests

614
00:27:20,510 --> 00:27:21,960
ahead of the entire team?

615
00:27:22,880 --> 00:27:23,680
Li Sirui,

616
00:27:24,160 --> 00:27:25,830
you're so selfish.

617
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:32,590
Yeah,

618
00:27:33,510 --> 00:27:34,920
I'm selfish.

619
00:27:35,270 --> 00:27:36,920
I know what your dream is:

620
00:27:37,030 --> 00:27:38,790
to bring the championship back to JCU.

621
00:27:38,790 --> 00:27:40,160
That's admirable.

622
00:27:40,680 --> 00:27:41,590
But have any of you thought

623
00:27:41,590 --> 00:27:43,200
about your own futures?

624
00:27:43,270 --> 00:27:44,160
How many of us

625
00:27:44,160 --> 00:27:46,290
could actually play professionally?

626
00:27:46,790 --> 00:27:49,920
Can we compete with players
who've been training since they were kids?

627
00:27:49,920 --> 00:27:51,440
If we don't go pro,

628
00:27:51,440 --> 00:27:52,680
what are we supposed to do?

629
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:54,680
Can we make a living on dreams alone?

630
00:27:55,680 --> 00:27:57,140
-Yunze.
-What do you want?

631
00:27:57,200 --> 00:27:57,640
Yunze.

632
00:27:57,640 --> 00:28:00,350
You screw up, and now you're acting like
you're in the right?

633
00:28:00,350 --> 00:28:01,810
Still spouting nonsense!

634
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:03,960
-Come on, let's drop it.
-Say that one more time. I dare you.

635
00:28:03,960 --> 00:28:06,360
I'll give you one more chance.
Say it again.

636
00:28:06,830 --> 00:28:07,880
Yunze, drop it.

637
00:28:08,430 --> 00:28:10,430
Can we make a living on dreams alone?

638
00:28:12,350 --> 00:28:13,070
Yunze.

639
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:26,640
Li Sirui,

640
00:28:27,510 --> 00:28:29,110
I'm asking you one more time.

641
00:28:31,960 --> 00:28:34,090
Do you still want to play with us or not?

642
00:28:51,000 --> 00:28:52,200
Go change, everyone.

643
00:28:53,590 --> 00:28:54,270
Go.

644
00:29:31,060 --> 00:29:33,170
[Li Sirui]

645
00:30:24,960 --> 00:30:26,200
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

646
00:30:31,010 --> 00:30:31,720
Keep going.

647
00:30:37,870 --> 00:30:40,340
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

648
00:30:49,550 --> 00:30:54,200
[Bai Xue Entertainment]

649
00:30:54,330 --> 00:30:56,370
[Article 1: Employment Relationship]
[Article 2: Scope of Services]

650
00:31:01,510 --> 00:31:02,440
How does it look?

651
00:31:03,440 --> 00:31:04,110
Ms. Bai,

652
00:31:04,590 --> 00:31:06,480
the contract looks fine overall.

653
00:31:06,480 --> 00:31:07,680
There's just one clause.

654
00:31:07,680 --> 00:31:09,160
"Party B shall not engage
in any romantic relationships

655
00:31:09,160 --> 00:31:10,640
during the initial period
of the contract."

656
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:12,480
What does that mean?

657
00:31:13,070 --> 00:31:14,930
It's for your own good, of course.

658
00:31:15,070 --> 00:31:17,640
The company has development plans

659
00:31:17,640 --> 00:31:19,310
for all newly signed players.

660
00:31:19,960 --> 00:31:21,830
No matter which direction you take,

661
00:31:21,700 --> 00:31:27,620
[Bai Xue Entertainment]

662
00:31:21,960 --> 00:31:23,680
a romantic relationship

663
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:25,140
could affect your career.

664
00:31:25,620 --> 00:31:28,730
It's also a way for the company
to protect its interests.

665
00:31:28,730 --> 00:31:30,480
I completely understand that.

666
00:31:30,550 --> 00:31:31,240
But

667
00:31:31,880 --> 00:31:34,590
how long does the initial signing period

668
00:31:35,070 --> 00:31:36,200
last?

669
00:31:37,550 --> 00:31:40,510
That depends on the individual.

670
00:31:40,890 --> 00:31:43,370
For example, if you maintain
steady popularity on variety shows,

671
00:31:41,790 --> 00:31:44,080
[Bai Xue Entertainment]

672
00:31:43,400 --> 00:31:44,530
then you'll be fine.

673
00:31:46,100 --> 00:31:49,960
[Le Xiaotao]

674
00:31:51,560 --> 00:31:52,140
[Le Xiaotao]

675
00:31:54,310 --> 00:31:55,030
Excuse me.

676
00:31:58,240 --> 00:32:00,040
Sirui, do you have a girlfriend?

677
00:32:03,510 --> 00:32:04,240
No.

678
00:32:05,550 --> 00:32:06,950
Then there's no problem.

679
00:32:08,530 --> 00:32:10,680
I've also drawn up a plan for you.

680
00:32:10,830 --> 00:32:11,960
I'd like you to start by appearing

681
00:32:11,960 --> 00:32:13,310
on some popular basketball variety shows.

682
00:32:13,310 --> 00:32:15,200
That'll raise your profile

683
00:32:15,200 --> 00:32:17,030
and bring in a good income.

684
00:32:17,920 --> 00:32:19,270
With your potential,

685
00:32:19,270 --> 00:32:20,830
our company can

686
00:32:20,830 --> 00:32:22,160
easily negotiate
a fee of five figures per episode

687
00:32:22,160 --> 00:32:23,160
for you.

688
00:32:25,440 --> 00:32:26,680
Thank you for putting so much thought
into this, Ms. Bai.

689
00:32:26,680 --> 00:32:28,750
Let's do as you suggest.

690
00:32:31,590 --> 00:32:33,650
Looking forward to working with you.

691
00:32:41,030 --> 00:32:42,640
[Player's Signature: Li Sirui]

692
00:33:31,240 --> 00:33:33,160
So, anything you feel like eating?

693
00:33:33,160 --> 00:33:34,550
I'll take you somewhere.

694
00:33:34,550 --> 00:33:35,240
No.

695
00:33:36,200 --> 00:33:38,590
Then is there anywhere you want to go?

696
00:33:39,070 --> 00:33:40,680
I'll carry you there in my arms.

697
00:33:40,680 --> 00:33:42,400
I'm not that badly injured.

698
00:33:45,920 --> 00:33:48,450
Then is there anything
you want to talk about?

699
00:33:49,640 --> 00:33:52,500
You can treat me
like your personal sounding board.

700
00:33:59,350 --> 00:34:01,400
Tell me, Li Sirui's decision

701
00:34:03,480 --> 00:34:06,200
wasn't right or wrong, was it?

702
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:09,199
People have to grow up

703
00:34:10,190 --> 00:34:11,510
and face the things

704
00:34:11,670 --> 00:34:13,110
they'd rather not face.

705
00:34:16,070 --> 00:34:17,770
Everyone has their own path.

706
00:34:18,630 --> 00:34:20,280
What makes me angry is

707
00:34:20,840 --> 00:34:21,670
that he made this decision

708
00:34:21,670 --> 00:34:23,530
without even talking to Xiaotao.

709
00:34:23,760 --> 00:34:25,620
Xiaotao's really upset now, too.

710
00:34:27,800 --> 00:34:30,440
And after all the hard work it took
to reach the semifinals,

711
00:34:30,440 --> 00:34:31,510
he just walks away...

712
00:34:31,510 --> 00:34:32,320
Don't worry.

713
00:34:33,320 --> 00:34:35,550
It's not my first time
leading the team on my own.

714
00:34:35,550 --> 00:34:37,320
Plus, Chen Yu and Kong Fang

715
00:34:38,110 --> 00:34:39,480
are better than they used to be, too.

716
00:34:39,480 --> 00:34:40,710
They can help shoulder the load.

717
00:34:40,710 --> 00:34:42,710
And our teamwork has improved a lot.

718
00:34:44,320 --> 00:34:46,510
We're not giving up this time.

719
00:34:50,280 --> 00:34:51,230
Tian told me

720
00:34:51,800 --> 00:34:53,000
to get plenty of rest,

721
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:55,120
and that's exactly what I'll do.

722
00:34:58,840 --> 00:35:01,400
Then I'll take you out
for something delicious.

723
00:35:01,400 --> 00:35:02,840
Three-pointer!

724
00:35:06,670 --> 00:35:07,360
Let's go.

725
00:35:08,960 --> 00:35:09,760
I missed it.
